WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.700
Models are adding voice, images, video or agents that carry out chained steps. The more autonomous steps a tool takes, the more it matters to set permission limits and human confirmation.

2
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:29.700
To keep up, prioritise release notes, public safety guidance and short hands-on tests rather than alarmist headlines or promises of easy money. Goal: tell real improvements from exaggerated marketing and keep lasting habits.

3
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:43.800
An «autonomous agent» appears that offers to book flights, pay with your card and send emails in your name. Your task: decide which permission you should never give it without step-by-step confirmation.

4
00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:52.900
Hint: a mistake in a draft can be deleted; a payment or an email sent to your boss cannot.

5
00:00:52.900 --> 00:01:00.100
Now do the lesson exercises. If you are unsure, watch this video again.
